Put the shadow setting on the popup menu page

The Popup menus page carries the settings that act on the popup window
as a whole. Row 15 gives it a border and row 16 colours it. The new
check box continues that run.

The border and the shadow are already a pair in the dialog. The tooltip
of Border popupmenus tells the user to keep the border unless the
window manager draws a shadow. One half of that pair had a switch and
the other had none.

The label reads Drop shadow, which pairs the switch with Drop shadow
size on the Advanced Settings page. A user then reads the two as one
control and its size. The word custom keeps the Use custom shadows
setting of the Window Manager page apart from both.

All three dialogs take the same six edits. The Qt 4 and Qt 5 dialogs
carry the same widgets at the same rows, and parity is the norm of the
tree.

The change sits on the branch work/popup-shadow of the local tree, as
the third commit. The fork wyn/qtcurve holds that branch. Merge request
!19 on system/qtcurve holds that branch.

Drop this patch when upstream merges the change.

diff --git a/qt4/config/qtcurveconfig.cpp b/qt4/config/qtcurveconfig.cpp
index 47ac103a..7da67fb2 100644
--- a/qt4/config/qtcurveconfig.cpp
+++ b/qt4/config/qtcurveconfig.cpp
@@ -1057,6 +1057,7 @@ QtCurveConfig::QtCurveConfig(QWidget *parent)
     connect(borderMenuitems, SIGNAL(toggled(bool)), SLOT(updateChanged()));
     connect(shadePopupMenu, SIGNAL(toggled(bool)), SLOT(shadePopupMenuChanged()));
     connect(popupBorder, SIGNAL(toggled(bool)), SLOT(updateChanged()));
+    connect(popupShadow, SIGNAL(toggled(bool)), SLOT(updateChanged()));
     connect(progressAppearance, SIGNAL(currentIndexChanged(int)), SLOT(updateChanged()));
     connect(progressColor, SIGNAL(currentIndexChanged(int)), SLOT(progressColorChanged()));
     connect(customProgressColor, SIGNAL(changed(const QColor &)), SLOT(updateChanged()));
@@ -3056,6 +3057,7 @@ void QtCurveConfig::setOptions(Options &opts)
     opts.borderMenuitems=borderMenuitems->isChecked();
     opts.shadePopupMenu=shadePopupMenu->isChecked();
     opts.popupBorder=popupBorder->isChecked();
+    opts.popupShadow=popupShadow->isChecked();
     opts.progressAppearance=(EAppearance)progressAppearance->currentIndex();
     opts.progressColor=(EShade)progressColor->currentIndex();
     opts.customProgressColor=customProgressColor->color();
@@ -3336,6 +3338,7 @@ void QtCurveConfig::setWidgetOptions(const Options &opts)
     borderMenuitems->setChecked(opts.borderMenuitems);
     shadePopupMenu->setChecked(opts.shadePopupMenu);
     popupBorder->setChecked(opts.popupBorder);
+    popupShadow->setChecked(opts.popupShadow);
     progressAppearance->setCurrentIndex(opts.progressAppearance);
     progressColor->setCurrentIndex(opts.progressColor);
     customProgressColor->setColor(opts.customProgressColor);
@@ -3717,6 +3720,7 @@ bool QtCurveConfig::settingsChanged(const Options &opts)
          borderMenuitems->isChecked()!=opts.borderMenuitems ||
          shadePopupMenu->isChecked()!=opts.shadePopupMenu ||
          popupBorder->isChecked()!=opts.popupBorder ||
+         popupShadow->isChecked()!=opts.popupShadow ||
          defBtnIndicator->currentIndex()!=(int)opts.defBtnIndicator ||
          sliderThumbs->currentIndex()!=(int)opts.sliderThumbs ||
          handles->currentIndex()!=(int)opts.handles ||
